Just for completeness I should note that this implies that you cannot  
run the REPL because that would be running on the R thread which is  
concurrent to the calling Java thread and thus you'd have to  
synchronize them. In practice R is always run on a separate thread,  
but without REPL it's just calling sleep() so it doesn't perform any R  
callbacks.

Cheers,
Simon


