Message-ID: <alpine.LRH.2.00.0908261326420.818@helix.nih.gov>

Hi Simon,

I've resolved the issue. It seems that I had R_HOME\bin in the Windows 
Path. In addition, I added R_HOME with \bin to the path.  I had 
the R_HOME environment variable set the whole time. I am not sure why 
R_HOME needed to be in the Windows Path but it seems to have fixed it. 
The JVM no longer exits with an error 10.

John

