rniAssign (and JRI assign() methods) has been changed in JRI 0.5-1  
(rJava 0.7-1) to return boolean defining whether the assignment  
succeeded or not -- no more crashes (it's a little slower since it has  
to setup its own context, but it should not be noticeable unless you  
assign some millions of objects).

Thanks,
Simon


